      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DUN SPRUIKIN (1) had been working towards a win and it arrived last week when he got home by 1.2m at this circuit and distance. Rises a little in grade but is likely to get the favours from another good draw so could get the job done again. BUTTER CUP (2) came from much wider when midfield behind a smart one last time and had come from the back row to place in her previous three outings here. She is much better served by this draw. CLEAR LEFT NZ (4) draws better than in his last two attempts in higher-graded races. Back from a five-week freshen but he is proven at this circuit and distance. DEEPWATER CAM (7) draws wide but has some good form under the belt, finishing second at Cowra last start and winning here three back.",
